  "cves": [
    {
      "id": "CVE-2025-13647",
      "publishedDate": "2026-11-02T09:20:52.186Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-11-02T09:20:52.186Z",
      "description": "The affected component fails to enforce expected validation constraints on the `content-type` header when processing certain requests. This allows an attacker to submit a crafted request with a manipulated `content-type` header.\n\nSuccessful exploitation can lead to the unintended exposure of the file paths for certificate files. This information disclosure could potentially be leveraged in subsequent attacks or compromise the confidentiality of the system.",
      "severity": 5.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：WSO2 WSO2 Identity Server\n🔓 漏洞类型：Exposure of Sensitive Information (CWE-200)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://security.docs.wso2.com/en/latest/security-announcements/security-advisories/2026/WSO2-2025-4751/",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
